    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep Dish Dungeon is a co-operative online multiplayer game where a group of players must unite to survive the treacherous depths of a mysterious dungeon. In an immersive 3D environment, you'll need to navigate puzzling passageways and gather resources to improve your camping site. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must prepare nourishing meals to bolster  strength throughout the journey. Players must come to grips with the intricate challenges that await them, for the dungeon boasts a dynamic ecosystem wherein every element plays a pivotal role. Encounter enemies with diverse behaviors, discover coveted treasures, and unravel enigmas within its depths.</p>",
